  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absolute Radiation Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Captain_Atom_Anti-Magic.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190313010717\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Captain Atom Anti-Magic\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Captain_Atom_Anti-Magic.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190313010717\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Captain_Atom_Anti-Magic.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190313010717 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/50/Captain_Atom_Anti-Magic.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20190313010717 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Captain Atom Anti-Magic\" width=\"270\" height=\"417\" data-image-key=\"Captain_Atom_Anti-Magic.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Captain Atom Anti-Magic.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Captain Atom (DC Comics) can endlessly absorb any form of radiation into himself.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Store an infinite amount of radiation in your body.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>store an infinite or nearly infinite amount of radiation in your body</b>. Advanced version of <a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Absorption\" title=\"Radiation Absorption\">Radiation Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Energy Absorption\">Absolute Energy Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Reactive_Perpetuator\" title=\"Bio-Reactive Perpetuator\">Bio-Reactive Perpetuator</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Comics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comics</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Analysis_&amp;_Discussions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Analysis &amp; Discussions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Radiation_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absolute Radiation Storage</li>\n<li>Infinite Radiation Absorption</li>\n<li>Ultimate Radiation Capacitor</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Radiation_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user's body is capable of containing an infinite amount of radiation in all its forms, they can absorb as much as they want. This can allow the user the energy required to use other superhuman abilities, survive long amounts of time without food, or output energy for long periods of time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Radiation_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Capacitor\" title=\"Bio-Capacitor\">Bio-Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Radiation Manipulation\">Bio-Radiation Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Reactor\" title=\"Energetic Reactor\">Energetic Reactor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Electromagnetic_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Electromagnetic Absorption\">Absolute Electromagnetic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Heat_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Heat Absorption\">Absolute Heat Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Ionic_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Ionic Absorption\">Absolute Ionic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Nuclear_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Nuclear Absorption\">Absolute Nuclear Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Quantum_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Quantum Absorption\">Absolute Quantum Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Wave_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Wave Absorption\">Absolute Wave Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Condition_Infinitum\" title=\"Condition Infinitum\">Condition Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Beauty_Infinitum\" title=\"Beauty Infinitum\">Beauty Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence_Infinitum\" title=\"Intelligence Infinitum\">Intelligence Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Level_Infinitum\" title=\"Power Level Infinitum\">Power Level Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Infinitum\" title=\"Speed Infinitum\">Speed Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stamina_Infinitum\" title=\"Stamina Infinitum\">Stamina Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength_Infinitum\" title=\"Strength Infinitum\">Strength Infinitum</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Radiation\">Personal Radiation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Ionization\" title=\"Personal Ionization\">Personal Ionization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Power\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Power\">Personal Nuclear Power</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Particle_Vibration\" title=\