-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiosynthesis\" title=\"Radiosynthesis\">Radiosynthesis</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiological_Capacitor\" title=\"Radiological Capacitor\">Radiological Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Conversion\" title=\"Radiation Conversion\">Radiation Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Cosmic_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Cosmic Conversion\">Radiative-Cosmic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Electromagnetic_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Electromagnetic Conversion\">Radiative-Electromagnetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Electric_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Electric Conversion\">Radiative-Electric Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Fire_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Fire Conversion\">Radiative-Fire Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Heat_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Heat Conversion\">Radiative-Heat Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Ion_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Ion Conversion\">Radiative-Ion Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Plasma_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Plasma Conversion\">Radiative-Plasma Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Pressure_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Pressure Conversion\">Radiative-Pressure Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Synergy_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Synergy Conversion\">Radiative-Synergy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Atomic_Transmutation\" title=\"Radiative-Atomic Transmutation\">Radiative-Atomic Transmutation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Surgery_Conversion\" title=\"Radiative-Surgery Conversion\">Radiative-Surgery Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Radiative-Nuclear Dynamo\">Radiative-Nuclear Dynamo</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiative-Weather_Modification\" title=